{"id": "f8d643d8-a7e6-4e7c-a2bf-516b38cb5f21", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) General Information 1. What is Cooperative Bank of Oromia?\nCooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) is a financial institution in Ethiopia that provides banking services including savings, loans, digital banking, and investment solutions.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "448e86ca-a556-4a44-9938-ce64c19ff17f", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) General Information 2. When was CBO established?\nCBO was established in 2004 to promote financial inclusion and cooperative banking services in Ethiopia.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "4dcebad1-1e12-4d8f-b066-a11a37226c76", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) General Information 3. Who owns CBO?\nThe bank is primarily owned by cooperative societies, unions, and individual shareholders.\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "4a9349c0-6854-4570-8d5e-4315fa0d16bb", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Accounts 4. What types of accounts does CBO offer?\nCBO offers:\n- Savings Accounts\n- Current Accounts\n- Fixed Deposit Accounts\n- Youth and Women-focused Accounts", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "e27362bc-e910-4aa1-8cfc-2911b3bc096b", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Accounts 5. What documents are required to open an account?\nTo open an account, you typically need:\n- Valid ID (Kebele ID, Passport, or Driver\u2019s License)\n- Passport-size photographs\n- Initial deposit", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "8037781e-cb72-4abb-90ea-40212ab1ffd1", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Accounts 6. Can I open an account online?\nYes, CBO supports digital account opening through its mobile banking platform (subject to eligibility).\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "24e0882d-a1f4-40e7-b81f-a991ea8bc145", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Digital Banking 7. What digital banking services does CBO provide?\nCBO offers:\n- Mobile Banking App\n- Internet Banking\n- USSD Banking\n- ATM Services", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "dbeca2da-89f6-4c9d-b277-086b09db32a4", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Digital Banking 8. How do I register for mobile banking?\nYou can register by visiting a branch or using the CBO mobile app and following the registration steps.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "a5fadde7-6b8e-42f5-ac17-5c3b0fb27183", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Digital Banking 9. Is mobile banking secure?\nYes, CBO uses encryption, PIN protection, and authentication mechanisms to ensure secure transactions.\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "463defe7-92b1-4082-9c2f-25501e67b37c", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Loans and Financing 10. What types of loans are available?\nCBO provides:\n- Personal Loans\n- Business Loans\n- Agricultural Loans\n- Microfinance Loans", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "9fc15830-edbf-4be9-b4f7-de5ca29ad633", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Loans and Financing 11. What are the requirements for getting a loan?\nRequirements may include:\n- Valid identification\n- Proof of income or business\n- Collateral (depending on loan type)", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "7df94abd-1f3f-4662-8b53-adc9f9d64e2e", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Loans and Financing 12. How long does loan approval take?\nLoan approval time varies but typically ranges from a few days to a couple of weeks.\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "43907286-7432-40b6-89af-9012af8dfa03", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Cards and Payments 13. Does CBO provide ATM or debit cards?\nYes, customers receive ATM/debit cards for account access and transactions.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "96b73ad5-c747-4d58-8572-ad6fc785b671", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Cards and Payments 14. Can I use my CBO card internationally?\nInternational usage depends on the card type and bank policies.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "35f6f2ca-daae-45aa-935c-6a66d803177f", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Cards and Payments 15. What should I do if my card is lost or stolen?\nImmediately report to the bank via customer support or visit the nearest branch to block the card.\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "e45a3957-82fc-4976-af47-4dd9b7538265", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Transfers and Payments 16. Can I transfer money to other banks?\nYes, CBO supports interbank transfers through national payment systems.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "fa7aadaf-4b6d-4cc0-9e21-fe1386fab722", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Transfers and Payments 17. Are there transaction fees?\nYes, fees vary depending on the service (transfer type, channel, amount).\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "abae0780-bf91-4e58-8483-66bf9d65aa2c", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Customer Support 18. How can I contact CBO?\nYou can contact CBO through:\n- Branch visits\n- Customer service hotline\n- Official website or social media channels", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "95b391c7-ed9f-43da-b30f-41044f844791", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Customer Support 19. What are the working hours?\nMost branches operate during standard business hours (Monday to Saturday), but hours may vary by location.\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "7e9e73e4-bea6-4c43-91d4-22f11940b7fb", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Security and Compliance 20. How does CBO protect customer data?\nCBO follows strict security protocols, including encryption and compliance with national banking regulations.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "35bd7f6e-b1d9-47dd-bb8c-a47dadea50f2", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Security and Compliance 21. What should I do if I notice suspicious activity?\nReport immediately to customer support or visit a branch to secure your account.\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "fde9d051-cfd6-4638-bf0c-0ce88500b5ca", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Additional Services 22. Does CBO support cooperative financing?\nYes, CBO specializes in cooperative-based financing and supports unions and associations.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "ba838183-ac9a-4117-8491-2ea1eea8f347", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Additional Services 23. Does the bank offer investment services?\nYes, including fixed deposits and other financial products.\n---", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
{"id": "4575859d-5c75-4792-8b52-49e1862fcde8", "text": "Cooperative Bank of Oromia (CBO) \u2013 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Notes\n- Policies and services may change over time.\n- For the most accurate and updated information, contact the nearest CBO branch.", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_name": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "file_type": ".md", "file_size": 3737, "creation_date": "2026-04-07", "last_modified_date": "2026-04-07", "document_id": "dc42ee0edbc945addc5b9a037a022110ba828597", "filename": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "source_path": "/home/bilisuma/Desktop/rag-deep-agent/upload/cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md", "relative_path": "cooperative_bank_of_oromia_faq.md"}}
